  "Cumulative bonus you\u0027ll get for cooking recipes according to their level\n 5% : You get 5% time bonus for each recipe level\n lvl 1(\u002B5%) / lvl 2(\u002B10%) / lvl 3(\u002B15%) / lvl 4(\u002B20%) / lvl 5(\u002B25%)\n 50% : lvl 1(\u002B50%) / lvl 2(\u002B100%) / lvl 3(\u002B150%) / lvl 4(\u002B200%) / lvl 5(\u002B250%)\n e.g. with 5% bonus, a recipe lvl 5, cooking for 2 hours (prep \u002B cooking time) will count for 2.5 hours": "",
