  "Top Left": "",
  "Horizontal offset": "",
  "Distance from that corner, as a percentage of the screen width. 0 is in the corner and 100 the opposite side. 50 here with 50 below is the middle of the screen; one at 0 and the other at 50 is a middle edge.": "",
  "Vertical offset": "",
  "Distance from that corner, as a percentage of the screen height.": "",
  "Size": "",
  "Height of the icon on the game\u0027s interface, so it scales with the interface rather than with your resolution.": "",
  "Opacity": "",
  "How strongly the icon is drawn. The game\u0027s own icons are slightly muted, so full strength stands out a little.": "",
